{"id":"e020171435fa55d1","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbgraphposiform.md","title":"用边变量实现任意加权图为冲突图","display":"thm-pbgraphposiform — 用边变量实现任意加权图为冲突图","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbgraphposiform","aliases":["27-thm-pbgraphposiform"],"display":"thm-pbgraphposiform — 用边变量实现任意加权图为冲突图","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbposiconflict]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.4.4, Theorem 13.16","source_printed_pages":"592","source_pdf_pages":"616","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbgraphposiform"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbgraphposiform</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbgraphposiform — 用边变量实现任意加权图为冲突图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c5e4aaa7e95ef90\" href=\"?note=0c5e4aaa7e95ef90\" title=\"27-df-pbposiconflict\">27-df-pbposiconflict</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.4.4, Theorem 13.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"592"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"616"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=[r]\">\\(V=[r]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\{\\{u,v\\}:u,v\\in V,u\\ne v\\}\">\\(E\\subseteq\\{\\{u,v\\}:u,v\\in V,u\\ne v\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:V\\to\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(w:V\\to\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。每条边<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in E\">\\(e\\in E\\)</span>选定有序端点<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u_e,v_e)\">\\((u_e,v_e)\\)</span>且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{u_e,v_e\\}=e\">\\(\\{u_e,v_e\\}=e\\)</span>；空积为1。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c5e4aaa7e95ef90\" href=\"?note=0c5e4aaa7e95ef90\" title=\"27-df-pbposiconflict\">27-df-pbposiconflict</a> 的冲突概念不依赖坐标重编号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\coloneqq\\{v\\in V:\\forall e\\in E\\;(v\\notin e)\\},\\qquad Q\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times E)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\coloneqq\\{v\\in V:\\forall e\\in E\\;(v\\notin e)\\},\\qquad Q\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times E)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall v\\in V\\quad T_v:\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\quad T_v(x)\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\prod_{\\substack{e\\in E\\\\u_e=v}}x_{(0,e)}\\right)\n\\left(\\prod_{\\substack{e\\in E\\\\v_e=v}}(1-x_{(0,e)})\\right)\n\\left(\\prod_{\\substack{i\\in I\\\\i=v}}x_{(1,i)}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall v\\in V\\quad T_v:\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\quad T_v(x)\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\prod_{\\substack{e\\in E\\\\u_e=v}}x_{(0,e)}\\right)\n\\left(\\prod_{\\substack{e\\in E\\\\v_e=v}}(1-x_{(0,e)})\\right)\n\\left(\\prod_{\\substack{i\\in I\\\\i=v}}x_{(1,i)}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\psi:\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\quad\\psi(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{v\\in V}w(v)T_v(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\psi:\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\quad\\psi(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{v\\in V}w(v)T_v(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u,v\\in V,\\ u\\ne v\\quad\n\\left((\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\;T_u(x)T_v(x)=0)\\Longleftrightarrow\\{u,v\\}\\in E\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u,v\\in V,\\ u\\ne v\\quad\n\\left((\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\;T_u(x)T_v(x)=0)\\Longleftrightarrow\\{u,v\\}\\in E\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{Q}}\\psi(x)=\n\\max_{\\substack{S\\subseteq V\\\\\\forall e\\in E\\;(e\\nsubseteq S)}}\\sum_{v\\in S}w(v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{Q}}\\psi(x)=\n\\max_{\\substack{S\\subseteq V\\\\\\forall e\\in E\\;(e\\nsubseteq S)}}\\sum_{v\\in S}w(v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每条边变量仅在两端点项中以相反极性出现，故恰产生该冲突边；其他顶点项没有相反文字。孤立顶点单独使用一个变量，使各项非空。有限坐标集可双射重编号为[n]，应用稳定集证明。r=0时空图和0元立方体相容。这是原书双部子图覆盖构造的每条边单独覆盖特例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbposiconflict","status":"resolved","id":"0c5e4aaa7e95ef90","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbposiconflict]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbposiconflict","status":"resolved","id":"0c5e4aaa7e95ef90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$r\\in\\mathbb N$，$V=[r]$，$E\\subseteq\\{\\{u,v\\}:u,v\\in V,u\\ne v\\}$，$w:V\\to\\mathbb R_{>0}$。每条边$e\\in E$选定有序端点$(u_e,v_e)$且$\\{u_e,v_e\\}=e$；空积为1。[[27-df-pbposiconflict]] 的冲突概念不依赖坐标重编号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"V=[r]","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\{\\{u,v\\}:u,v\\in V,u\\ne v\\}","display":false},{"tex":"w:V\\to\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in E","display":false},{"tex":"(u_e,v_e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{u_e,v_e\\}=e","display":false},{"tex":"I\\coloneqq\\{v\\in V:\\forall e\\in E\\;(v\\notin e)\\},\\qquad Q\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times E)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times I).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall v\\in V\\quad T_v:\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\quad T_v(x)\\coloneqq\n\\left(\\prod_{\\substack{e\\in E\\\\u_e=v}}x_{(0,e)}\\right)\n\\left(\\prod_{\\substack{e\\in E\\\\v_e=v}}(1-x_{(0,e)})\\right)\n\\left(\\prod_{\\substack{i\\in I\\\\i=v}}x_{(1,i)}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\psi:\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\quad\\psi(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{v\\in V}w(v)T_v(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall u,v\\in V,\\ u\\ne v\\quad\n\\left((\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{Q}\\;T_u(x)T_v(x)=0)\\Longleftrightarrow\\{u,v\\}\\in E\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\max_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^{Q}}\\psi(x)=\n\\max_{\\substack{S\\subseteq V\\\\\\forall e\\in E\\;(e\\nsubseteq S)}}\\sum_{v\\in S}w(v).","display":true}],"bytes":2077,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbgraphposiform|thm-pbgraphposiform — 用边变量实现任意加权图为冲突图]]"}],"outgoing":["0c5e4aaa7e95ef90"]}